1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,110
Narrator: Listen to a health teacher talking to students.

2
00:00:03,110 --> 00:00:06,200
Teacher: There's no way around it.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,090
Smoking is terrible for your health.

4
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:12,080
It can lead to cancer and heart disease.

5
00:00:12,080 --> 00:00:15,900
Although it may seem harmless to smoke just one cigarette

6
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:19,110
smoking one can lead to smoking many more.

7
00:00:19,110 --> 00:00:24,060
Cigarettes are filled with special chemicals that make you want to smoke.

8
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:29,150
Once you start smoking, it could be difficult to stop.
